[Music]  Abby Lee Miller was recently  hospitalized for a lingering back injury  and now et has learned more about the  underlying cause of her pain according  to doctor Michael Russo who performed  the dance Monstars gastric sleeve  surgery last year  Abby's current situation is not a good  one with Abby's consent he told ET quote  her hypothyroidism got so severe she had  an assortment of symptoms bone pain in  her back shoulders arms and legs so what  exactly is hypothyroidism dr. Russo says  it's when your thyroid gland isn't  functioning properly which can lead to  weight gain quote if left untreated it's  been reported people can become comatose  this is a serious medical concern dr.  Russo told ET Abby was instructed by  another doctor to stop taking her  thyroid meds at the end of January  thankfully he and Abby addressed the  issue quickly and he said she's already  feeling better  Abby has since returned to the halfway  house she's living in where she's  serving the remainder of her prison  sentence

